*.local
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The run ledger is per-checkout state, not history. A clone should not arrive holding someone
# else's half-finished run, and the gates would enforce its phases against work that is not yours.
.polaris/runs/.open*
.polaris/runs/.composed-log
.polaris/runs/*/state.json

# Per-session tracker notes, written at Stop and merged into streams.md by /polaris:track. They are
# one session's uncommitted view, not history: a clone should not arrive holding notes it cannot
# attribute, and streams.md is where the merged record lives.
.polaris/work/pending/
